# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored — never commit real keys.
#
# Google Cloud speech-to-text key, from a project with the "Cloud
# Speech-to-Text API" enabled and billing turned on — see
# console.cloud.google.com, Credentials. Used as the default when no key has
# been entered in Settings; a key typed in Settings takes precedence over
# this one.
#
# Note: .env is bundled into the APK as an asset, so anyone with the APK can
# read this value. Fine for a personal build; don't ship it publicly.
GOOGLE_SPEECH_API_KEY=
